menu "BMP280 configuration"

config BMP280_I2C_SDA_GPIO
    int "BMP280 I2C SDA GPIO"
    range 0 27
    default 10
    help
        GPIO connected to the BMP280 SDA pin. GPIO10 is exposed on J3 of
        ESP32-H2-DevKitM-1 and is otherwise unused by this application.

config BMP280_I2C_SCL_GPIO
    int "BMP280 I2C SCL GPIO"
    range 0 27
    default 11
    help
        GPIO connected to the BMP280 SCL pin. GPIO11 is exposed on J3 of
        ESP32-H2-DevKitM-1 and is otherwise unused by this application.

endmenu
